---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P2｜Editor's Note｜J 的世界 Research" page="P2" section="EDITOR'S NOTE">
<div class="poster">
  <div class="poster-orbit"></div><div class="poster-vertical-label">FACTS FIRST · EDITORIAL</div>
  <div class="poster-inner">
    <div class="poster-top">
      <div class="poster-kicker">P1 · EDITOR'S NOTE · 2026.06.25</div>
      <div class="poster-title">為什麼想聊<br/>台積電 6/25 技術論壇？</div>
      <div class="poster-sub">從一場技術論壇，看 AI 基礎建設下一個十年的變化</div>
      <div class="poster-rule"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-split">
      <div class="poster-panel dark"><div class="poster-kicker">EDITOR'S NOTE</div><h3 style="font-size:1.65rem;line-height:1.35;margin:12px 0;color:#fff">不是因為台積電很重要，<br/>而是這場論壇把「技術鏈」攤開了。</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#dbe4ee">這次研究的起點，不是找一檔股票，而是從公開技術資訊開始，看看製程、封裝、光互連、材料與基礎設施，如何一起推動下一代 AI Platform。</p></div>
      <div class="poster-panel"><div class="poster-kicker">FOUR SIGNALS</div><div class="poster-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:16px"><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Compute Scaling</h3><p>運算持續往更高密度前進。</p></div><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Advanced Packaging</h3><p>封裝成為系統整合關鍵。</p></div><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">03</div><h3>Optical Interconnect</h3><p>資料傳輸開始成為瓶頸。</p></div><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">04</div><h3>Materials & Infrastructure</h3><p>材料、電力、散熱一起升級。</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-footer"><strong>J 的世界 Research</strong><span>從事件出發 · 回到產業結構</span><span>P1</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>把話說白一點</strong>科技產業的週期很長，市場的波動卻很短。研究的目的，是先把技術演進與產業結構看懂，再去觀察哪些訊號真的開始發生。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
